BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Transfer planning: launch windows</h1>
Delta-gliders on the ground at Baikonur and at Cape Canaveral in March 2001.
The script plans a transfer to the Moon from Baikonur and one to Mars from
Cape Canaveral: the launch
opportunities into a parking orbit that contains the transfer's departure
direction. For each, it then puts the glider into the planned parking orbit at its
insertion time and checks that the ejection from there needs no plane change.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.6685767396
  Script Tests/LaunchPlanTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship GL-L
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET GL-L
  MODE Extern
  POS 4 0 -20
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
GL-L:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Earth
  POS -80.6826150 28.5969630
  HEADING 90.00
  PRPLEVEL 0:1.000 1:1.000
END
GL-B:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Earth
  POS 63.342 45.920
  HEADING 90.00
  PRPLEVEL 0:1.000 1:1.000
END
END_SHIPS
